<x-layouts.public title="FAQ | afacere.online">
    <section class="hero"><p class="muted">FAQ</p><h1>Questions entrepreneurs reasonably ask.</h1></section>
    <div class="grid">
        <article class="card"><h3>Do I need an account?</h3><p>Not to understand the product or pricing. An account is required to save an evaluation and continue into the private business workflow.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Can I manage more than one business?</h3><p>Yes. The commercial model distinguishes one-business and unlimited-business plans, with limits enforced server-side.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Does AI make decisions for me?</h3><p>No. AI is an assistance layer. Deterministic eligibility and authorization rules remain in application code.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>What happens to previous evaluations?</h3><p>They remain historical versions. A new evaluation does not silently rewrite the old one.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Is payment live?</h3><p>The product keeps billing provider concerns behind an abstraction boundary. The application can present plan state before a production payment provider is connected.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>What are Guides and Opportunities?</h3><p>Guides support execution with practical steps. Opportunities surface relevant external or internal options when eligibility can be established.</p></article>
    </div>
</x-layouts.public>
